            "heading": "Automatic Dishwasher Gel",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Automatic Dishwasher Gel Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to High-Purity Water Blog\"><strong>High-Purity Water </strong></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong>• charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized</p><p>Tetrasodium Glutamate Diacetate (plant-based cleaner)</p><p>Octyl Dimethyl Amine&nbsp;Oxide (plant-based cleaner)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Citric Acid Blog\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a> (shine enhancer)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-metasilicate?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Sodium Metasilicate blog\"><strong>Sodium Metasilicate</strong></a> (grease lifter)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Phenoxyethanol blog\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a> (safe preservative)</p><p>Caprylyl Glycol (safe preservative)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrengthwholesale.com/products/lemon-lime-orange-grapefruit-essential-oil-blend?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Sunburst Citrus Essential Oil Blend product listing\"><strong>Sunburst Citrus</strong></a> Essential Oil Blend (scent)</p>",
            "page": ""
