          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Bubble Bath",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Bubble Bath Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to High Purity Water blog\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a> (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated water)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Sodium C14-16 Alpha Olefin Sulfonate blog\"><strong>Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong></a> (coconut-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine blog\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong></a> (mild coconut-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/cocamidopropyl-betaine-in-household-cleaning-products-and-personal-care-items-what-you-need-to-know?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Cocamidopropyl Betaine blog\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine</strong></a> (coconut-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Coco-Glucoside blog\"><strong>Coco-Glucoside</strong></a> (plant-based cleanser)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Vegetable Glycerin blog\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin (glycerin)</strong></a> (plant-based, hydrates skin,<br/>USP kosher)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside blog\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong></a> (plant-based cleanser)</p><p><strong>Polyquaternium 10 </strong>(gives skin soft feel)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Polysorbate 20 blog\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a> (food-grade, USP kosher with no dioxane,<br/>plant-based formula stabilizer)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-benzoate?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Sodium Benzoate blog\"><strong>Sodium Benzoate</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-potassium-sorbate?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Potassium Sorbate blog\"><strong>Potassium Sorbate</strong></a><strong>, Capryl Glycol</strong> and<br/><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Phenoxyethanol blog\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a> (food-grade preservatives, used sparingly to prevent bacteria<br/>from growing in container)</p><p><strong>Cucumis Sativus Fruit Extract</strong> (Cucumber Extract, hydrates<br/>skin)</p><p><strong>DL-Panthenol</strong> (Provitamin B5, plant-based, hydrates skin)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Citric Acid blog\"><strong>Citric Acid </strong></a>(balances pH)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Essential Oils blog\"><strong>Essential Oils</strong></a>and/or<a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Fragrance Oils blog\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil</strong> </a>• Scent<br/><br/></p>",
