            "heading": "Castile Soap",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Castile Soap Ingredients</p><p>Organic Trade Association. GMO-Free. 100% biodegradable.<br/>Septic & greywater-safe</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Water blog\">Water</a></p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coconut-oil-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Coconut Oil blog\">Organic Coconut Oil</a></p><p>Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil</p><p>Organic Castor Oil</p><p>Organic Sunflower Oil</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/unlock-the-soothing-power-of-aloe-vera-leaf-juice-for-hair-and-skin-your-ultimate-guide?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Aloe blog\">Organic Aloe</a></p><p>Potassium Hydroxide</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Citric Acid blog\">Citric Acid</a></p>",
            "page": ""
