        "collapsible_row_m9bwaw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Coconut Conditioner",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Conditioner Ingredients</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to High Purity Water blog\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cetyl-alcohol-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Cetyl Alcohol blog\"><strong>Cetyl Alcohol</strong></a><strong> </strong>(softens, smooths hair)</p><p>Behentrimonium Methosulfate (plant-based detangler)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coconut-oil-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Coconut Oil blog\"><strong>Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil </strong></a><br/>(moisturizes and seals)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-shea-butter-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Shea Butter blog\"><strong>Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter)</strong> <strong>Fruit</strong></a><strong> </strong>(moisturizes)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glyceryl-stearate-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Glyceryl Stearate blog\"><strong>Glyceryl Stearate</strong></a> (veggie-based, protective barrier. PEG-free) </p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Polysorbate 20 blog\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a> (plant-based formula stabilizer. USP, food-grade, kosher quality, containing no dioxane)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Sodium Gluconate blog\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(helps hydrate scalp and follicles)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Phenoxyethanol blog\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong>, Caprylyl Glycol </strong>(preservatives used sparingly, prevents bacteria from growing in container)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Essential Oils blog\"><strong>Essential Oils</strong></a><strong> and/or </strong><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Fragrance Oils blog\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oils</strong></a> (scent, if scented)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_GEdyUp": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Dish Soap",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Dish Soap Ingredients:</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to High Purity Water blog\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to C-14-16 Alpha Olefin Sulfonate blog\"><strong>Sodium C14-C16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong></a> (This mild-surfactant helps grab oil, dirt,<br/>and grease. It is also derived from coconuts, palm-free and is  biodegradable.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine blog\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong> </a>(Naturally derived from coconut, palm-free, it is a biodegradable conditioning agent for the skin with high foaming and mild<br/>chemistry.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/cocamidopropyl-betaine-in-household-cleaning-products-and-personal-care-items-what-you-need-to-know?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Cocamidopropyl Betaine blog\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine</strong></a> (Naturally derived from coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly, high-foaming, and biodegradable surfactant with mild chemistry.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Coco-Glucoside blog\"><strong>Coco-Glucoside</strong></a> (A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and safe for sensitive skin.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Vegetable Glycerin blog\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin</strong></a> (Derived from vegetables. It is a biodegradable,<br/>powerful moisturizer that can increase skin hydration. Food-grade &<br/>USP kosher.)</p><p><strong>Tetrasodium Glutamate Diacetate</strong> (A natural mineral that helps remove minerals from hard water.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Sodium Gluconate blog\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a> (A natural mineral that helps remove minerals from<br/>hard water.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside blog\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong> </a>(A biodegradable plant-based surfactant with mild chemistry and sensitive skin compatibility.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Polysorbate 20 blog\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong> </a>(Plant-based surfactant that helps stabilize the<br/>formula when adding essential oils or phthalate-free fragrances. <em>Biodegradable.<br/>USP kosher. Food-Grade. 100% Dioxane-free.)</em></p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol</strong> & <a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Phenoxyethanol blog\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a> (Safe preservatives that are used sparingly in order to prevent bacteria from growing in container.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Citric Acid blog\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a> (Balances pH)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Essential Oil blog\"><strong>Essential Oil</strong></a>and/or<a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Fragrance Oil blog\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil </strong></a>(scent, if scented)<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
