            "row_content": "<p>Floor Cleaner Ingredients</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to High Purity Water blog\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside blog\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside </strong></a>(A biodegradable plant-based surfactant with mild chemistry and sensitive skin compatibility.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-ethyl-alcohol?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Ethyl Alcohol blog\"><strong>Alcohol (Ethyl)</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Speeds drying.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Coco-Glucoside blog\"><strong>Coco-Glucoside </strong></a>(A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and safe for sensitive skin.)</p><p><strong>Sodium Citrate </strong>(formula stabilizer)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Sodium Gluconate blog\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Mineral based. Helps grab and remove metals.)</p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol, </strong><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Phenoxyethanol blog\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong> </a>(preservatives used sparingly, prevents bacteria from growing in container)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Citric Acid blog\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a> <strong> </strong>(Plant-based. Neutralizes PH.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Essential Oils blog\"><strong>Essential Oils </strong></a>and/or <a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Fragrance Oil blog\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil</strong> </a>• Scent</p>",
