            "heading": "Lots of Purpose Multipurpose Cleaner",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>Lots of Purpose Cleaner Ingredients</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to High Purity Water blog\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-ethyl-alcohol?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Ethyl Alcohol blog\"><strong>Alcohol (Ethyl) </strong></a>(Speeds drying.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Caprylyl Capryl blog\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong> </a>(A biodegradable plant-based surfactant with mild chemistry and sensitive skin compatibility.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Coco-Glucoside blog\"><strong>Coco- Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and safe for sensitive skin.)</p><p><strong>Sodium Citrate </strong>(Mineral based. Helps grab and remove minerals.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Sodium Gluconate blog\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Mineral based. Helps grab and remove metals.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Phenoxyethanol blog\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong> & Caprylyl Glycol</strong> (gentle preservatives, used sparingly to prevent bacteria growth)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Citric Acid blog\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a><strong> </strong>(neutralizes pH)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Essential Oil blog\"><strong>Essential Oil</strong></a><strong> </strong>and/or <a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Fragrance Oil blog\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil </strong></a>(scent, if scented)<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
