            "heading": "Pet Shampoo",
            "icon": "paw_print",
            "row_content": "<p>Pet Shampoo Ingredients</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to High Purity Water blog\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine blog\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine </strong></a>(Naturally derived from coconut, palm-free, it is a biodegradable conditioning agent for hair and skin with high foaming and mild chemistry)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Sodium C14-16 Alpha Olefin Sulfonate blog\"><strong>Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(This mild-surfactant helps grab oil, dirt, and grease. It is also derived from coconuts, palm-free and is biodegradable)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/cocamidopropyl-betaine-in-household-cleaning-products-and-personal-care-items-what-you-need-to-know?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Cocamidopropyl Betaine blog\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Naturally derived from coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly, high-foaming, and biodegradable surfactant with mild chemistry)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Vegetable Glycerin blog\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin (glycerin) </strong></a>(Derived from vegetables. It is biodegradable and helps the plant surfactants do their job. Food-grade & USP kosher)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Coco-Glucoside blog\"><strong>Coco- Glucoside</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and<br/>safe for sensitive skin)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A plant-based surfactant that increases lather potential with mild chemistry for sensitive skin)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Polysorbate 20 blog\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Plant-based surfactant that helps stabilize the formula when<br/>adding essential oils or phthalate-free fragrances. <em>Biodegradable. Kosher.<br/>Food-Grade. 100% Dioxane-free)</em></p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-chloride?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Sodium Chloride blog\"><strong>Sodium Chloride</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Salt)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-benzoate?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Sodium Benzoate blog\"><strong>Sodium Benzoate</strong></a><strong> & </strong><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-potassium-sorbate?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Potassium Sorbate blog\"><strong>Potassium Sorbate</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Food-grade preservatives that are used sparingly to prevent bacteria from growing in the container)</p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol & </strong><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Phenoxyethanol blog\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol </strong></a><strong>(</strong>Safe preservatives which are used sparingly to prevent bacteria from growing in container)</p><p>Wild Heart Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil (<a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Essential Oils blog\"><strong>Essential Oil</strong></a> & <a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-potassium-sorbate?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Fragrance Oils blog\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil</strong></a> Blend (pet safe scent), if scented)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Lrwmca": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Deodorizing Pet Spray",
            "icon": "paw_print",
            "row_content": "<p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-ethyl-alcohol?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Ethyl Alcohol blog\"><strong>Ethyl Alcohol</strong></a> (deodorizer)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to High Purity Water blog\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong> </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><strong>Sorbitan Oleate Decyglucoside Crosspolymer</strong> (solubilizer and emulsifier)</p><p>Wild Heart Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil (<a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Essential Oils blog\"><strong>Essential Oil</strong></a> & <a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-potassium-sorbate?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Link to Fragrance Oils blog\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil</strong> </a>Blend (pet safe scent))</p><p>Rustic Strength fragrance oils are 100% certified free of the 624 carcinogens<br/>and 323 reproductive/ developmental toxins listed under California’s Prop 65<br/>act.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
